{% comment %}
  Product description for the buy box.

  Typed copy wins over the product's own description, which is what lets a
  shared template run a short buy-box line while the full description stays on
  the product record for the tabs further down the page.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the desc block. Reads settings.desc.
  - product {Object} - product used for the fallback copy.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-desc__block', block: block, product: hero_product %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if block.settings.desc != blank or product.description != blank -%}
  <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__desc cwc-rte" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if block.settings.desc != blank -%}
      {{ block.settings.desc }}
    {%- else -%}
      {{ product.description }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
